10 REM ---------------------------------------------------------------
11 REM BENCH - ETAP 0 AND 8: HOW FAST IS THE MAIN LOOP ON THIS MACHINE
12 REM
13 REM THERE IS NO WALL CLOCK HERE, SO THE HUMAN IS THE CLOCK: START A
14 REM STOPWATCH, PRESS A KEY, PRESS ANOTHER KEY AFTER TEN SECONDS.
15 REM THE PRINTED COUNT DIVIDED BY TEN IS TICKS PER SECOND.
16 REM
17 REM TEST 1 IS THE BARE LOOP: KEY POLL ONLY.
18 REM TEST 2 IS THE LOOP PLUS TWO CELL SIZED FILLS, WHICH IS WHAT ONE
19 REM MOVE OF A PIECE COSTS. THE GRAVITY TABLE AT LINE 10200 OF
20 REM TETRIS.BAS IS IN TICKS OF TEST 2, NOT OF TEST 1.
21 REM ---------------------------------------------------------------
30 SCREEN 3
40 COLOR 7,0
50 CLS
60 REM ---- TEST 1: BARE LOOP ----
70 GOSUB 500
80 TK%=0
90 KB$=INKEY$
100 IF KB$<>"" THEN GOTO 130
110 TK%=TK%+1
120 GOTO 90
130 SCREEN 0
140 PRINT "BARE LOOP TICKS";TK%
150 REM ---- TEST 2: LOOP WITH TWO CELL FILLS ----
160 SCREEN 3
170 COLOR 7,0
180 CLS
190 GOSUB 500
200 TK%=0
210 KB$=INKEY$
220 IF KB$<>"" THEN GOTO 270
230 LINE @(300,100)-@(309,109),7,BF
240 LINE @(300,100)-@(309,109),0,BF
250 TK%=TK%+1
260 GOTO 210
270 SCREEN 0
280 PRINT "DRAWING LOOP TICKS";TK%
290 PRINT "DIVIDE BY THE SECONDS YOU MEASURED"
300 END
500 REM ---- WAIT FOR THE START KEY ----
510 KB$=INKEY$
520 IF KB$="" THEN GOTO 510
530 RETURN
